<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classMemoryInFiles" kindref="compound">MemoryInFiles</ref> class is used for asynchronous reads of memory from storage and writes of memory to storage. The intention is to allow LTP to use this as a storage mechanism for long delays and high rates which would require too much RAM otherwise. It is single threaded and must be run by the thread running ioServiceRef. </para>
</sect1>
